SO IT BEGINS

100
00:03:47,894 --> 00:03:51,147
<i>Murder Mystery is
a competitive deduction game</i>

101
00:03:51,148 --> 00:03:55,943
<i>where you try to identify
the culprit hidden among you.</i>

102
00:03:55,944 --> 00:03:58,863
<i>You will each be assigned a unique role</i>

103
00:03:58,864 --> 00:04:01,240
<i>and play the game as that character.</i>

104
00:04:01,241 --> 00:04:03,200
<i>There is only one culprit,</i>

105
00:04:03,201 --> 00:04:07,037
<i>but every player has their own secret.</i>

106
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:09,748
<i>To win this game,
you are allowed to lie, conceal the truth,</i>

107
00:04:09,749 --> 00:04:12,877
<i>and act deceptively.</i>

108
00:04:12,878 --> 00:04:16,005
<i>The game consists of five rounds.</i>

109
00:04:16,006 --> 00:04:17,756
<i>At the start of each round,</i>

110
00:04:17,757 --> 00:04:20,176
<i>one clue will be revealed
to the entire group,</i>

111
00:04:20,177 --> 00:04:24,930
<i>and all the players will pick out
one card clue and one object clue.</i>

112
00:04:24,931 --> 00:04:27,099
<i>The card clues are confidential</i>

113
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:31,562
<i>and can only be shared
during private conversations.</i>

114
00:04:31,563 --> 00:04:35,483
<i>The object clues
can be examined by all players.</i>

115
00:04:35,484 --> 00:04:39,987
<i>After collecting the clues,
you will have a 15-minute discussion.</i>

116
00:04:39,988 --> 00:04:43,324
<i>Starting Round 2, you will have time
for private conversations.</i>

117
00:04:43,325 --> 00:04:46,327
<i>After the group discussion,
you will have five minutes</i>

118
00:04:46,328 --> 00:04:48,370
<i>to talk secretly
in the private conversation zones.</i>

119
00:04:48,371 --> 00:04:51,540
<i>In Round 5, the final round,
you will make your final vote.</i>

120
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:53,083
<i>After the final group discussion,</i>

121
00:04:53,084 --> 00:04:56,880
<i>you will vote for the person
you suspect to be the culprit.</i>

122
00:04:57,631 --> 00:05:00,341
<i>Now, you will be assigned your roles.</i>

